<title>USA: Unitech reorganization plan confirmed.</title>
<headline>Unitech reorganization plan confirmed.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unitech Industries Inc, and its Unitech Acquisition Corp unit, doing business as Solidex, said their reorganization plan was confirmed.</p>
<p>The court order confirming the plan was entered on December 13, 1996.  Unitech and Solidex sought Chapter 11 bankruptcy protection on January 25, 1996.</p>
<p>Unitech is a designer and manufacturer of cellular and camcorder battery packs, desktop charger, and power supplies for OEM and distributor customers. Solidex is a distributor and manufacturer of video tape reminders, video accessories, computer carrying cases, and camera bags.</p>
</text>
